# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 24.04,$
# whose logger is rsyslog. A server whose row is over the row's$
# width: the key alone, and the whole value under it.$
$
# Syslog Settings ##############################################$
$
  [+] Syslog               Configured syslog-collector.prod.e...$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               rsyslog$
  [+] Server$
      syslog-collector.prod.example.com:6514 TLS Open$
   -  CA File              /etc/ssl/lab-ca.pem$
   -  File                 /etc/rsyslog.d/60-hardn-forward.conf$
   -  Set by               hardn$
   -  hardn.yml$
      syslog-collector.prod.example.com:6514 TLS$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Stop forwarding      Undo hardn's change$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

